id: CL:0020057
name: cholinergic neuron of myenteric plexus
def: "An enteric neuron whose soma resides in the myenteric plexus and which is capable of acetylcholine secretion, neurotransmission. This is a defined grouping class that autoclassifies stubby Dogiel type I neurons, intrinsic primary afferent neurons, ascending interneurons, and their morphological/chemical subterms." [PMID:34170401, PMID:37355216]
