relationship: in_taxon NCBITaxon:7742 ! Vertebrata <vertebrates>
relationship: part_of GO:0021680 ! cerebellar Purkinje cell layer development
relationship: part_of GO:0021699 ! cerebellar cortex maturation
relationship: RO:0002299 UBERON:0002979 ! results in maturation of Purkinje cell layer of cerebellar cortex

