relationship: in_taxon NCBITaxon:7742 ! Vertebrata <vertebrates>
relationship: part_of GO:0007422 ! peripheral nervous system development
relationship: part_of GO:0048486 ! parasympathetic nervous system development
relationship: RO:0002296 UBERON:0011929 ! results in development of postganglionic parasympathetic fiber

