[Term]
id: GO:0072219
name: metanephric cortical collecting duct development
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the metanephric cortical collecting duct over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The metanephric cortical collecting duct is the portion of the metanephric collecting duct that resides in the renal cortex." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
