created_by: mah
creation_date: 2010-03-18T03:37:16Z

[Term]
id: GO:0072227
name: metanephric macula densa development
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the metanephric macula densa over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The metanephric macula densa is an area of specialized cells in the distal tubule of the metanephros that makes contact with the vascular pole of the glomerulus." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
is_a: GO:0072024 ! macula densa development
is_a: GO:0072243 ! metanephric nephron epithelium development
