created_by: mah
creation_date: 2010-03-18T03:41:23Z

[Term]
id: GO:0072235
name: metanephric distal tubule development
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the metanephric distal tubule over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The metanephric distal tubule is a metanephric nephron tubule that begins at the metanephric macula densa and extends to the metanephric connecting tubule." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
