creation_date: 2010-03-18T03:45:37Z

[Term]
id: GO:0072236
name: metanephric loop of Henle development
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the metanephric loop of Henle over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The metanephric loop of Henle is a metanephric nephron tubule that connects the proximal convoluted tubule to the distal convoluted tubule in the metanephros." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
synonym: "metanephric intermediate tubule development" EXACT []
