is_a: UBERON:0034921 ! multi organ part structure
relationship: contributes_to_morphology_of UBERON:0001846 ! internal ear
relationship: has_quality PATO:0000404 {gci_relation="part_of", gci_filler="NCBITaxon:32525", source="Wikipedia"} ! coiled
