synonym: "tractus spinocerebellaris ventralis" RELATED OMO:0003011 [NeuroNames:808]
synonym: "ventral spinocerebellar tract" EXACT [FMA:72642]
synonym: "ventral spinocerebellar tract (Gowers)" RELATED [NeuroNames:808]
