[Term]
id: UBERON:0004771
name: posterior nasal aperture
def: "Opening/conduit between the nasal cavity and the nasopharynx[AAO] The choanae are separated by the vomer[WP]." [AAO:0000093, Wikipedia:Posterior_nasal_apertures]
subset: human_subset
