property_value: external_definition "The spinocerebellar tract is a set of axonal fibers originating in the spinal cord and terminating in the ipsilateral cerebellum. This tract conveys information to the cerebellum about limb and joint position[Wikipedia:Spinocerebellar_tract]." xsd:string {source="Wikipedia:Spinocerebellar_tract"}

