synonym: "ductus excretorius glandulae vesiculosae" RELATED OMO:0003011 [Wikipedia:Excretory_duct_of_seminal_gland]
synonym: "excretory duct of seminal gland" EXACT [FMA:19473]
synonym: "seminal vesicle duct" EXACT [FMA:19473]
