synonym: "proper palmar digital arteries" EXACT [MA:0001959]
synonym: "proper palmar digital arteries set" EXACT [FMA:70804]
synonym: "proper volar digital arteries" RELATED [Wikipedia:Proper_palmar_digital_arteries]
