[Term]
id: UBERON:0006972
name: nephridium
def: "An exceretory tubule that usually opens to the exterior by a nephridiopore. The inner end of the tubule may be blind, ending in flame cells (protonephridium) or may open into the coelom through a ciliated funnel (metanephridium)." [Wikipedia:Nephridium]
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
