[Term]
id: UBERON:0008193
name: pneumatized bone
def: "A bone that is hollow or contains many air cells, such as the mastoid process of the temporal bone[TMD]." [http://www.medilexicon.com/medicaldictionary.php?t=11303]
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
