is_a: UBERON:0035555 ! lateral line sense organ
relationship: capable_of GO:0050956 ! electroception
relationship: never_in_taxon NCBITaxon:32443 {source="Wikipedia"} ! Teleostei
relationship: never_in_taxon NCBITaxon:32523 ! Tetrapoda
relationship: part_of UBERON:0002540 ! lateral line system
relationship: present_in_taxon NCBITaxon:119203 ! Selachii
