[Term]
id: UBERON:0008942
name: gastropod cerebral ganglion
def: "The cerebral ganglia are primarily sensual centres, that compute information from the eyes as well as from the tactile and position sensors (statocystes). Besides coordination they also serve the locational memory of a snail." [BTO:0001843]
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
