name: closed circulatory system
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
is_a: UBERON:0001009 {source="GO"} ! circulatory system
property_value: editor_note "consider merging with cardiovascular system?" xsd:string
property_value: taxon_notes "The circulatory systems of all vertebrates, as well as of annelids (for example, earthworms) and cephalopods (squid and octopus) are closed, just as in humans. Still, the systems of fish, amphibians, reptiles, and birds show various stages of the evolution of the circulatory system" xsd:string

