[Term]
id: UBERON:0009976
name: hypothalamo-hypophyseal system
def: "An intrinsic circulatory network that transports hormones from the median eminence of the hypothalamus to the adenohypophysis." [ISBN:0471888893, Wikipedia:Hypophyseal_portal_system]
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
