id: UBERON:0010289
name: scleral cartilage
def: "Circular cartilage ringing the posterior portion of the eye in the sclera. Supports the eye." [http://www.fishbase.org/glossary/Glossary.php?q=scleral+cartilage]
synonym: "scleral cartilage element" EXACT [PMID:17051547]
