synonym: "perpendicular plate of the ethmoid bone" RELATED [Wikipedia:Perpendicular_plate_of_ethmoid_bone]
synonym: "vertical plate of the ethmoid bone" RELATED [Wikipedia:Perpendicular_plate_of_ethmoid_bone]
