synonym: "cleidocervicalis muscle" EXACT [Wikipedia:Levator_claviculae_muscle]
synonym: "levator claviculae" EXACT [Wikipedia:Levator_claviculae_muscle]
synonym: "musculus levator claviculae" EXACT OMO:0003011 [Wikipedia:Levator_claviculae_muscle]
synonym: "omocervicalis" EXACT [Wikipedia:Levator_claviculae_muscle]
