property_value: external_definition "Region of the vertebral column posterior to the sacrum consisting of two to four vertebrae. The last of these vertebrae is distinguished by the possession of a well-developed haemal arch; it supports the posterior part of the cloaca and marks the posterior limit of the trunk.[AAO]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-06-20", external_class="AAO:0000080", ontology="AAO", source="AAO:Duellman_and_Treub_1994"}

