[Term]
id: UBERON:0012453
name: nerve ending
def: "Specialized terminations of peripheral neurons. Nerve endings include NEUROEFFECTOR JUNCTION(s) by which neurons activate target organs and sensory receptors (see RECEPTORS, SENSORY) which transduce information from the various sensory modalities and send it centrally in the nervous system. Presynaptic nerve endings are PRESYNAPTIC TERMINALS." [MESH:A08.800.550]
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
synonym: "nerve ending" RELATED [MESH:A08.800.550]
xref: MESH:D009411
