[Term]
id: UBERON:0013538
name: Brodmann (1909) area 7
def: "Brodmann area 7 is one of Brodmann's cytologically defined regions of the brain. It is involved in locating objects in space. It serves as a point of convergence between vision and proprioception to determine where objects are in relation to parts of the body." [Wikipedia:Brodmann_area_7]
