xref: FMA:14772
xref: MA:0003095
xref: SCTID:244262006
xref: Wikipedia:Hepatic_artery_proper
is_a: UBERON:0001193 {source="MA"} ! hepatic artery
relationship: connecting_branch_of UBERON:0005436 {source="FMA"} ! common hepatic artery

