property_value: function_notes "They act to raise hair, quills, feathers, etc. It is also used in 'twitch' reflexes to shake off insects, etc.[Palaeos]" xsd:string
property_value: has_relational_adjective "pannicular" xsd:string
property_value: structure_notes "fine, flat muscles within the hypodermis. Their origin is in the deep fascia of bone and they insert into superficial skin." xsd:string
property_value: taxon_notes "In humans, the platysma has features of the panniculaus carnosus[ISBN:0123813611]." xsd:string

