name: amygdalohippocampal area
def: "A cytoarchitecturally defined portion of the periamygdalar area and the cortical amygdalar nucleus at the caudal extreme of the amygdala." [Wikipedia:Amygdalohippocampal_area]
subset: human_reference_atlas
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
synonym: "AHA" RELATED OMO:0003000 [DHBA:10377]
