def: "A bone foramen forming the superior indentation on the posterior aspect of the lateral mass of the atlas (C1), which when combined with the groove for the vertebral artery transmits the vertebral artery and the first cervical (suboccipital) nerve." [https://fipat.library.dal.ca/ta2/, ISBN:9780323393225, Wikipedia:Atlas_(anatomy)]
