[Term]
id: UBERON:2005233
name: obsolete CiD
def: "An interneuron of the spinal cord with an ipsilateral axon that extends ventral to the Mauthner axon then turns dorsally and caudally and sometimes has a minor ascending branch." [ZFIN:ZDB-PUB-010807-17]
