creation_date: 2020-09-08T15:05:03Z

[Term]
id: UBERON:8400003
name: hepatic acinus zone 2
def: "The region of the hepatic acinus in between zones 1 and 3. Blood in this region has an intermediate oxygen concentration relative to the other two zones of the hepatic acinus. Zone 2 is located in the midzonal region of the liver lobule. Hepatocytes in this region have mixed functionality in comparison with those in zones 1 and 3." [PMID:29763190]
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
synonym: "hepatic acinus intermediary zone" EXACT [PMID:28126520]
