relationship: part_of UBERON:0001898 ! hypothalamus
property_value: curator_notes "Lateral tuberal nucleus is listed as both an exact synonym and related synonym as the term has been used in both ways. See https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/2439 for more details. No homology links has been made as this is unclear from the literature." xsd:string

