def: "A circumferential reticular fiber that encircles a splenic sinusoid, forming part of the sinusoidal basement membrane and providing structural support to the vessel wall." [doi:10.1111/j.1365-2559.1986.tb02483.x, doi:10.2478/s11756-009-0193-5, PMID:15258183, PMID:2424311, PMID:6194184]
