def: "x preaxial to y iff x is further along the preaxial-postaxial axis than y, towards the front." [http://medical-dictionary.thefreedictionary.com/preaxial]
synonym: "anterior to (developmentally)" RELATED [MA:th]
synonym: "lateral (radial) to" RELATED []
synonym: "medial (tibial) to" RELATED []
